Source commit: 8909f221d1515955fc843808032bdc5d62209c96
npm gitHead 59585e1aac2d2e3503aa1caececf3568dce51a47 has identical template bytes.
Source: https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/blob/8909f221d1515955fc843808032bdc5d62209c96/crates/tauri-bundler/src/bundle/windows/msi/main.wxs
Upstream SHA256: e371a01628a06730828f9bd24111feacb8bec53c250ccec4b46df756fe0a0198
Local changes: per-user limited scope/Programs I; new custom-root key; explicit machine-022 blocker; per-user protocols and fixed official024 payload with HKCU key paths (ICE38/64).
No config field supplies this root/scope; PREINSTALL runs after SetOutPath.
Keep the small delta pinned; the retention pure tests reconstruct this digest.

